  "details": "1.) Open VRChat with User Icons turned off in Shield Levels.\n\n2.) Join an instance, seemingly random users will have a white image on top of the blurred out user icon. (screenshot attached)\n\n3.) Go into Shield Levels and turn User Icons on, they'll still be blurred out. Newly joining users will show them correctly and rejoining the instance seems to fix it, but the setting isn't functioning properly whether you're toggling it on or off.\n\nThis inconsistent behavior also happens in the menu, user profiles, etc.",
